          "type": "step",
          "id": "the-hidden-key:1e3xemc",
          "html": "Press the organ keys in the following order: 10x &quot;B&quot;, 7x &quot;A#&quot;, 1x &quot;G#&quot;, and 1x &quot;G&quot;. (small black keys are # notes)",
          "text": "Press the organ keys in the following order: 10x \"B\", 7x \"A#\", 1x \"G#\", and 1x \"G\". (small black keys are # notes)",
